# Place audio files here: WAV, 16-bit PCM, 8 kHz, mono.
# Example: demo-congrats.wav
#
# Not PCMU: the loader refuses anything that is not uncompressed PCM and does
# the µ-law conversion itself on the way out. Anything that is not already
# 8 kHz mono plays, but is resampled or downmixed on every single call.
